     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Experiences",
     "texto": [
      "**Har du varit…?** asks about an experience. The perfect is formed with **har + past participle**: **har rest**, **har sett**. Use the past simple if you say when it happened: **Jag reste i somras**."
